        "created_at": "2014-05-28T16:00:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Does mitigate trigger on damage dealt to a hero that is immune to it? Like say you mitigate and the T-Rex chomps on a danger sensed Legacy is the reduction still spent? (I'd say yes but I wanted to be sure)</p>",
